  "description": "The Snowplow Enriched Events Store (configuration ID\u202f3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6) connects to the PostgreSQL host **db.example.com**, using the database **snowplow_enriched** on the standard port\u202f5432. Data will be loaded with the PostgreSQL user **loader_user**, and the password is retrieved from the EC2 Parameter Store entry **/snowplow/db/password**. All tables reside under the **atomic** schema, and the connection employs JDBC SSL mode **REQUIRE** for encrypted traffic. This configuration is intended for storing **ENRICHED_EVENTS**.\n\nAccess to the database is routed through an SSH tunnel. The bastion host **bastion.example.com** listens on port\u202f22 and is accessed with the SSH user **ssh_user**; no passphrase is required. The SSH private key is also stored in EC2 Parameter Store under **/snowplow/ssh/key**. Inside the private network the database socket is reachable at **10.0.1.5:5432**, and the tunnel forwards traffic to the same local port\u202f5432 on the loader node.\n\nState management for the pipeline is handled via a processing manifest backed by an Amazon DynamoDB table named **snowplow_manifest**.",
  "reference_json": {
    "name": "Snowplow Enriched Events Store",
    "id": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "host": "db.example.com",
    "database": "snowplow_enriched",
    "port": 5432,
    "username": "loader_user",
    "password": {
      "ec2ParameterStore": {
        "parameterName": "/snowplow/db/password"
      }
    },
    "schema": "atomic",
    "sshTunnel": {
      "bastion": {
        "host": "bastion.example.com",
        "port": 22,
        "user": "ssh_user",
        "passphrase": null,
        "key": {
          "ec2ParameterStore": {
            "parameterName": "/snowplow/ssh/key"
          }
        }
      },
      "destination": {
        "host": "10.0.1.5",
        "port": 5432
      },
      "localPort": 5432
    },
    "processingManifest": {
      "amazonDynamoDb": {
        "tableName": "snowplow_manifest"
      }
    },
    "sslMode": "REQUIRE",
    "purpose": "ENRICHED_EVENTS"
  }
}